    english_customer_response_template: 'Hello, the identity risk investigation under ticket {{TICKET_ID}} is complete. The user flagged by identity protection was triaged with the full risk detail and correlated with sign-in history and other sources: the case was classified and remediated following the standard chain (all sessions revoked, credentials reset, and authentication factors re-enrolled with proper identity verification), and the risk state now reflects the verified remediation. We also reviewed the rest of the risk queue for related patterns and confirmed the risk-based access policy is active and enforcing automatically. The complete case report with the detection-to-remediation timeline is archived.',
    english_technical_explanation: 'ID Protection risky-user triage executed at {{TIMESTAMP}} for tenant {{TENANT}}: risk queue enumerated via Get-MgRiskyUser (riskState atRisk, prioritized by riskLevel) and per-user detections reviewed (credential-leak, anomalous sign-in, session token anomalies with dates). Correlation performed against SigninLogs for the risk window (successful anomalous IPs/devices, CA-blocked attempts as defense-in-depth evidence) and case classified (confirmed / context-based false positive / undetermined) with documented rationale. Confirmed cases remediated via the full chain (Revoke-MgUserSignInSession, forced credential reset, factor re-enrollment with identity verification) and risk state closed accordingly (remediated / dismissed with justification). Queue re-checked for campaign patterns, risk-based Conditional Access policy verified active, and the case report archived with detection-to-remediation timeline metrics.',
