    escalation: 'La denegación la causa un SCP de la organización (requiere cambio en la OU/policy de orgs): escalar al dueño de la landing zone/org con el evento y la justificación — JAMÁS resolverlo moviendo la cuenta fuera de la OU. Solicitudes de permisos que equivalgan a escritura amplia o administrativa sobre recursos compartidos: aprobación del dueño de la cuenta + revisión de seguridad antes de aplicar. AccessDenied intermitente (funciona a veces): sospechar credenciales cacheadas de un rol distinto o condición de IP que depende del egress — capturar get-caller-identity del momento exacto del fallo.',
    english_customer_response_template: 'Hello, the AWS AccessDenied issue under ticket {{TICKET_ID}} is resolved. We identified the exact denied API call from CloudTrail, evaluated the effective permissions (role policy, permissions boundary and organization policies) with the IAM Policy Simulator, and replaced the failing setup with a least-privilege policy that grants only the required action on the exact resources. The application owner confirmed the operation now succeeds, and the new policy version is documented with a review date. No wildcard or administrative permissions were granted.',
    english_technical_explanation: 'AccessDenied triage for role arn:aws:iam::{{ACCOUNT_ID}}:role/{{ROLE_NAME}} completed at {{TIMESTAMP}}: denied event located via CloudTrail lookup (errorCode AccessDenied with eventName and resource), effective permissions reproduced offline with iam:SimulatePrincipalPolicy (decision explicitDeny traced to resource ARN mismatch between identity policy and actual bucket path), permissions boundary and SCP ceiling verified, and a least-privilege policy v2 authored (single Allow for the exact action/resource, no action wildcards). Pre-apply validation via iam:SimulateCustomPolicy confirmed allowed for the target call and implicit deny for adjacent operations; post-apply CloudTrail shows the call succeeding with no errorCode. Policy version and review date recorded as audit evidence.',
    keywords: ['aws', 'iam', 'accessdenied', 'policy simulator', 'simulate-principal-policy', 'simulate-custom-policy', 'least privilege', 'politica json', 'aws iam', 'scp', 'permissions boundary', 'cloudtrail', 'lookup-events', 'get-caller-identity', 'sts', 'policy version', 'wildcard', 'action', 'resource', 'condition', 'effect', 'deny', 'allow', 'cloud'],
